the local plan we adopted in July 2020  was designed to take us up to 2031.  we're currently working on an updated  version which can be used until 2040.  as part of the local Plan update we have  put out two calls for sites the calls  for sites invited landowners land agents  and other stakeholders to suggest  locations that could be added to the  local plan and given a specific use  potential uses include residential  commercial or Industrial Development as  well as Open Spaces  a number of sites were submitted to us  for consideration  as locations that might be suitable for  specific purposes and Planet District  Council has suggested two sites to be  considered for affordable housing  we're publishing details of all the  sites that have been submitted for  consideration and you can see them on  our website  no decisions have been made about these  sites or their suitability for  development  they're all being reviewed now to see  whether they are actually suitable for  the use suggested  in September 2023 when we know which  sites are deemed suitable for use there  will be a chance for members of the  public to comment and share their views
 

